sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as 🎓 Student / roommates
    actor Staff as 🔧 Technician
    participant API as HostelDesk API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant CDN as Cloudinary

    Staff->>API: Start work
    API->>DB: Status IN_PROGRESS + new 4-digit code
    Student->>API: Open the ticket
    API-->>Student: Shows the code (occupants only, one endpoint)
    Staff->>API: Upload after-photo
    API->>CDN: Store image
    API->>DB: Attachment + server timestamp
    Student-->>Staff: Says the code once the fix is really done
    Staff->>API: Resolve with the code

    alt correct code
        API->>DB: Row-locked check, then RESOLVED
        API-->>Staff: Resolved
        Note over Student,API: 48-hour window opens: confirm closes it,<br/>a dispute reopens it, silence auto-closes it
    else wrong code
        API->>DB: Attempt counter + 1 (row-locked)
        API-->>Staff: Wrong code, attempts left
        Note over Staff,API: 5 wrong tries lock the ticket for 15 minutes
    end
